{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1423958400, "end_date": 1424563199, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:50:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "14580613", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003888207", "personaname": "I'm Feelin Perky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003888207/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 513, "last_played": 1637451655, "avatar": "4ad138da2cb027575d962122913a5a5e7759d8eb"}, "language": "english", "review": " Literally the only game where you feel like you can both take on the whole world, and feel powerless while facing hundreds of enemies at the same time. I loved every second of it.", "timestamp_created": 1424543689, "timestamp_updated": 1424543689, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14573811", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972628029", "personaname": "Dogness", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dogness/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 680, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 644, "last_played": 1475687825, "avatar": "5a7464b365f8592015dd38056694899f00174267"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was an unexpected gem. Disappointed that they didn't make any sequels.\nIt somehow managed to mix elements from Gears of War, Call of Duty and the Batman Arkham series into something awesome.\nAlso, it made great use of the Warhammer 40k license.", "timestamp_created": 1424514964, "timestamp_updated": 1424514964, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14546733", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013051562", "personaname": "Sick", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198013051562/", "num_games_owned": 189, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 20352, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19832, "last_played": 1639233943, "avatar": "ef9dd31ddce72772543467fc72aee2ce5150a8a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "CAN NOT PLAY AS ORC EVRY1 LIEK ORCZ, LAGG RUIN GAEM Y NO GIFF SERVERZ LIEK DOW2 DO U EVN LOOK AT UR GAEM ?", "timestamp_created": 1424368229, "timestamp_updated": 1424368229, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 20, "weighted_vote_score": "0.364725589752197266", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14545853", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042701126", "personaname": "Rapxtor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rapxtor/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 262, "playtime_forever": 2214, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1191, "last_played": 1433996203, "avatar": "2f5f4a68d94196eb1cb8aa5cdac3f41e73d3639a"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very good exercice for the ones like me that have a stressfull job, its action from the get go until the end, its a diferent gameplay in the Warhammer universe, but i think the main objective was acomplished, deliver entertainement and on that regard, space marine worth it, even at current price with no sale discount.\n\nThe graphics not being nothing awesome, they are still good, voice acting very good and the story is good enough to keep you playing, but the strong point of this game is the gameplay full of action, gore and some funny moments with Orcs, who doesnt like Orcs?\n\nIf you are fan of this universe theme, space marine will let you experience what you already know in a completly diferent perspective, so il give this game 7.5/8 and recommend you to try out.", "timestamp_created": 1424364388, "timestamp_updated": 1424364388, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516748666763305664", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14536050", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034315837", "personaname": "peremptor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/peremptor/", "num_games_owned": 8940, "num_reviews": 1112, "playtime_forever": 99, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13, "last_played": 1430353517, "avatar": "fd9e7543680b218fa9779688f132b15045a85395"}, "language": "english", "review": "Real space marines don't wear helmets in space. Space orcs included.", "timestamp_created": 1424299745, "timestamp_updated": 1424299745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 30, "votes_funny": 14, "weighted_vote_score": "0.633575558662414551", "comment_count": 6, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}